# Project 2 – Microservices Application on EKS

## Architecture

Large applications are split into smaller services.

Example:

```text id="s8k2m4"

                 User

                  |

              API Gateway

                  |

 ---------------------------------

 |        |        |        |

User   Order   Payment   Product

Service Service Service Service

 ---------------------------------

                  |

               Database
```

---

# 1. Microservices Benefits

Advantages:

* Independent scaling
* Independent deployment
* Better fault isolation

---

# 2. Kubernetes Design

Each service has:

```text id="h6m9p2"

Deployment

Service

ConfigMap

Secret

HPA
```

Example:

```text
user-service

order-service

payment-service
```

---

# 3. Service Communication

Internal communication:

```text id="e3k7q1"

Order Service

        |

order-service.default.svc.cluster.local

        |

Database
```

---

# Project 3 – CI/CD Pipeline for EKS

